@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@employeeId = b5c179b8-96cc-48c9-af69-9fed7a4c4734
@slotId = 43e21ae0-71e0-448c-adfa-3666e554bfa5

### 1. Obține orele de lucru pentru un angajat
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/employees/{{employeeId}}/working-hours
Accept: application/json

### 2. Obține sloturile indisponibile (pentru o dată specifică)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/employees/{{employeeId}}/unavailable-slots?date=2026-11-20
Accept: application/json

### 3. Obține sloturile indisponibile (pentru un interval from-to)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/employees/{{employeeId}}/unavailable-slots?from=2026-11-16&to=2026-11-22
Accept: application/json

### 4. Creează un nou slot indisponibil (ex: concediu one-off)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/blocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "type": "TIME_OFF",
  "reason": "Concediu medical",
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "start": "09:00:00",
  "end": "17:00:00"
}

### 5. Șterge un slot indisponibil
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/blocks/{{slotId}}